  "prefLabel": "He-A 305.03 Registration Application Submission",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-A 305.03 Registration Application Submission.\n\n(a) Each applicant shall:\n\n(1) Complete and submit to the department a “New Hampshire Recovery Housing Registration Form” (May 2025) signed by the operator of the recovery house; and\n\n(2) Submit a copy of their current certification document issued by the certifying body.\n\n(b) The requirements in (a) above shall be submitted to the department via:\n\n(1) Email at recoveryhousing@dhhs.nh.gov;\n\n(2) Fax to (603) 271-6105; or\n\n(3) Mail or hand-delivery to:\n\nDepartment of Health and Human Services\n\nDivision of Behavioral Health Services\n\nBureau of Alcohol and Drug Services\n\n105 Pleasant Street\n\nConcord, NH 03301\n\nSource. #12821, INTERIM, eff 7-1-19, EXPIRED: 12-30-19\n\nNew. #12969, eff 1-8-20; ss by #13150, INTERIM, eff 12-30-20, EXPIRED 6-28-21\n\nNew. #13223, eff 6-26-21; amd by #14110, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 11-18-24, (para (a)), EXPIRES: 5-17-25; ss by #14252, eff 5-22-25, EXPIRES: 5-22-35",
